{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HdRitRWmhFZ7VxFEUBkpEs","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Travel Policy — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n2\t\n3\t## TRV-1 Airfare authorization\n4\tAirfare purchases above $800 require **advance travel-office approval**, in addition to the appropriate purchase approvals in the Expense Policy. Amounts of $800 or less do not require travel-office approval.\n5\t\n6\t## TRV-2 Independence of approvals\n7\tTravel-office approval never replaces manager approval or finance approval when otherwise required under the Expense Policy. All travel expenses are subject to the applicable purchase threshold.\n8\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ddebc4dd-db97-4bc3-8a39-1c9959e532d1","uuid":"4d340e1c-9c5c-4377-91cb-3749be0d59f8","timestamp":"2026-10-13T21:44:23.356Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\mmazu\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\cp14-seven-sessions-20261013\\C_SEVEN_01\\Q5\\02-travel-policy.md","content":"# Travel Policy — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n\n## TRV-1 Airfare authorization\nAirfare purchases above $800 require **advance travel-office approval**, in addition to the appropriate purchase approvals in the Expense Policy. Amounts of $800 or less do not require travel-office approval.\n\n## TRV-2 Independence of approvals\nTravel-office approval never replaces manager approval or finance approval when otherwise required under the Expense Policy. All travel expenses are subject to the applicable purchase threshold.\n","numLines":8,"startLine":1,"totalLines":8}}}
